  {
    "id": 2003007020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わあっ、こんばんはー！\r\n偶然だね、びっくりしたー！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いつものスーツじゃないから\r\n一瞬、プロデューサーって気づかなかったよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もだよ、ちょっとぼーっとしていて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見たところ買い物の帰り？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！　おつかい頼まれたんだ\r\n夜遊びしてたんじゃないよー？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "パン粉を切らしちゃったんだって！\r\nお夕飯のコロッケがハンバーグになるところだったよー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ついでに牛乳と醤油と……\r\nキッチンペーパーも……ほらっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……このアイスパフェも？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、それは頼まれてないけど……\r\nおつかいのお駄賃としていいかなーって……えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ちゃっかりしてるじゃないか\r\nしかし寒いのによくアイスなんて食べられるなあ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！　冬に暖かい部屋で\r\n食べるアイスは最高なんだよー！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でもやっぱり寒いから、\r\nホットココアも買っちゃったけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサーが持ってるのもココア？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよ。俺のは缶のココア",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それ、飲むっていうより、\r\n手を温める用に買ったんでしょー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よくわかったな\r\n本当はコーヒーが良かったけど品切れでさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だよねだよねっ！\r\nプロデューサーはコーヒーってイメージだもんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "甘いのは得意じゃないかもだけど…\r\n飲んだらもっと温まるから……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "冷めないうちがおすすめだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、そうするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんうんっ……\r\nいつもと違うのはココアもだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "スーツじゃないってことは\r\n今日はプロデューサーもお休みできたの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、無事に書類仕事が片付いたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "良かったー！　もしかしたら休めないかもって\r\n言ってたから気になってたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう。一日ゆっくりさせてもらったよ\r\n贅沢に昼まで寝て、午後は図書館に寄ってから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！　図書館！？　わたしも行ったよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、今日は学校に行くんじゃなかったか？\r\n土曜だけど部活の……ええと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "陸上部！　朝から昼までは走ってたよ\r\nそのあと図書館で宿題してたの！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "14時くらいだったかなー\r\n……その時間にはいた？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、俺もちょうど着いた頃だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんで気づかなかったんだろー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、宿題の邪魔をするわけにはいかないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もしプロデューサーを見つけてたら\r\nわからないところ教えてもらえたかもーって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……宿題、終わらなかったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お、終わったよ！\r\n友だちも手伝ってくれたから、なんとか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは何よりだ、友だちと勉強するのが一番だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも宿題の量だけでも見てもらいたかったな\r\n机の上にてんこ盛りだったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それだけ勉強できるのも今のうちだ\r\nそのうち懐かしくなるさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うう、懐かしくなってみたい……\r\n今はもう一生分、勉強した気がするよー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003007020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーは図書館からの帰り？\r\nあ、ちょっと待って──……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0103",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300702/2003007020290"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
